tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:13:- **P1 — options and publication.** `+` clusters contain only `x`; `-` clusters
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:14:  support `a/r/p/x`. Scan tokens/letters lexical left-to-right: `a/r/p` are sticky,
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:15:  the last `x` sign wins for scalars, and every request retains any-x-operation
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:16:  provenance. Validate the entire leading option region and global invocation
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:17:  usage before declaration-target publication. First operand or exact `--` ends
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:18:  option recognition. Named `-p` ignores supported attributes without mutation;
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:19:  unsupported flags still return 2. Unnamed listing intersects selected negative
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:20:  attribute filters and rejects any `+x` with 2. Scalar-syntax duplicates remain
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:21:  sequential; compound/element duplicate targets are global usage 2.
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:22:- **P2 — export guard.** A separate successful scalar `+x`, followed by later
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:23:  array conversion, is explicitly authorized. Same-invocation toggles cannot
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:24:  bypass the entry-exported scalar/exported-unset guard. Any `x` operation on
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:25:  an existing or requested indexed binding returns 1 regardless of its final
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:26:  sign, except named print's ignored attributes. Existing readonly/control
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:27:  guards remain; no export-history taint rule is introduced.
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:28:- **P3 — declaration and local absence.** Missing names and hidden local absence
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:29:  query with 1/no record; declared-unset queries with 0 and no assignment in its
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:30:  printed record, distinct from set-empty. Whole local unset removes observable
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:31:  membership but retains the owner-frame absence barrier. Nested unset changes
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:32:  the owning caller frame; nested local redeclaration saves/restores that absence,
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:33:  not the concealed parent. The original owning function's exit restores the
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:34:  exact saved binding and attributes once. Explicit `declare` recreates unset
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:35:  membership without a value, preserving the original frame save.
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:36:- **P4 — status, effects and precedence.** Invalid invocation usage returns 2
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:37:  before target publication, without undoing earlier expansion/redirection
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:38:  effects. Ordinary identifier/query/readonly/type/export/control/domain/stale/
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:39:  serialization refusals latch 1 and continue applicable operands/records;
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:40:  later success cannot clear it. Preparation/resource failure stops. A canonical
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:41:  decimal index outside `0..2147483647` is domain 1, not grammar 2. Private ledger
tests/shell/declare-independent-20260828/ratification-v3/RATIFIED.md:42:  exhaustion returns 1/stops; public `ShellLimitError` rejects, not 125/126.
